Output demo/pi-qwen.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.5

Hide
Type "cd ~/projects/pi_qwen"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Type "pi --model qwen3-coder-30b-a3b"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Type "explain the purpose of this codebase"
Enter
Sleep 60s

Hide
Type "/exit"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
